# With every graveyard empty the Pit's enters trigger has no card to target and "up to three" lets it do nothing (CR 115.1d, 603.3d):
# no target is asked (`! Bot1.Target`) and nothing is exiled. "If no cards are exiled with Pit of Offerings, its last ability can't
# add mana" (ruling 2023-11-10): on turn 3 it is offered and adds nothing (CR 106.5), while {T}: Add {C} adds {C} on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Pit of Offerings
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Pit of Offerings.Play
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Pit of Offerings.Activate(Ability: exiled)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Pit of Offerings.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile.Count = 0
